OL,3,GNEWSATwin's stillbirth inspires
OL,4,Agrieving father's children's book
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story covers stillbirths
OL,7,Fand some people may find the details
OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FOne date is etched into Richard
OL,11,FGanjavi's memory: 6 August 2024.
OL,13,FIt was the day for the routine 34-week
OL,14,Fscan for the twins he was expecting
OL,15,Fwith his wife, Naomi.
OL,17,F"The room went quiet. [The woman doing
OL,18,Fthe scan] said the words that shattered
OL,19,Feverything: "I'm so sorry, there isn't
OL,20,Fa heartbeat."
